{
  "headline": "Carboplatin shortage persists 42 months after FDA first posted it; Intas plant OAI and import alerts coincide with Accord supply disruption",
  "headline_cites": ["E31", "D4", "D5", "D6", "D7", "E18", "E19", "E20", "E16"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA first posted the carboplatin shortage on 2023-04-28 and as of 2026-10-21 it has been on the list for 42 months.",
      "cites": ["E31", "D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Accord Healthcare product (NDC 16729-295-12) is manufactured by Intas Pharmaceuticals Limited, which received an OAI classification after an inspection that ended 2022-12-02, with the classification letter dated 2023-04-05 — 147 days before the shortage posting.",
      "cites": ["E20", "E16", "D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA published Import Alert 66-40 for Intas on 2023-06-01 (34 days after the shortage posting) and again on 2023-11-14 (200 days after), and issued a Warning Letter on 2023-07-28 (91 days after).",
      "cites": ["D5", "D6", "D7", "E18", "E19", "E17"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Multiple other manufacturers remain on FDA's shortage list as Current, including Teva (estimated recovery December 2028), Fresenius Kabi (next release December 2026), Hospira/Pfizer (estimated recovery March 2027), Eugia US, Avyxa Pharma, and Teyro Labs.",
      "cites": ["E28", "E25", "E27", "E24", "E22", "E29"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Gland Pharma Limited is listed as Current but noted as Discontinued and distributed by BPI Labs LLC.",
      "cites": ["E26"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ingenus Pharmaceuticals is listed as To Be Discontinued effective 2026-02-20.",
      "cites": ["E30"]
    },
    {
      "text": "P&T has approved interchanges for Teva (NDC 00703423901) to Apotex/Teyro Labs (NDC 60505628201) and for Accord (NDC 16729029512) to Teva (NDC 00703423901) with pharmacist verification.",
      "cites": ["E32", "E33"]
    }
  ]
}
